###
# First execute login.http to set auth_token
###

### will succeed.
GET {{host}}{{api}}/users/b68c9bc2-0c4d-4136-b738-711e920ce47a
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### will throw 404
GET {{host}}{{api}}/users/1a37237f-02a9-4ea0-8981-6b85bdb21599
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### will throw 401
GET {{host}}{{api}}/users/1a37237f-02a9-4ea0-8981-6b85bdb21599
Accept: application/json

### will throw 401
GET {{host}}{{api}}/users/b68c9bc2-0c4d-4136-b738-711e920ce47a
Accept: application/json
